            "review_text": "Explorer17407168503\n3 contributions\n0\nNha Trang Bars\nJun 2024 • Friends\nMy friend and I were walking on the street when we were invited by a very lovely waiter to look at the menu. I was impressed by the environment inside, very relaxing and comfortable. I went up to the rooftop with everyone and sat down to have cocktails. The music was soft and the volume was just right for conversation. The waiters were very enthusiastic to recommend the menu and help us, even though our English was not very good. The cocktails were delicious, light and refreshing, perfect for the hot Nha Trang weather, haha.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten June 13, 2024\nSea Lounge Nha Trang\n非常感谢您的反馈。我们很高兴在那里为您带来美妙的体验。希望您和您的朋友下次光临\nTranslate response\nWritten June 14, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
